DESCRIPTION:Get ready to soar with beautiful music at the SRJC Orchestra's
  Take Flight concert! The music will be enhanced by projections of stunnin
 g photos of birds by SRJC student Mary McAllister. Joining the performance
  will be the Santa Rosa Symphony's Aspirante Youth Orchestra who will perf
 orm on the first half of the program. For the grand finale\, the two orche
 stras will join forces to perform Stravinsky's exciting Danse Infernale\, 
 Berceuse and Finale from his Firebird Suite. Don't miss this unique and aw
 e-inspiring concert!  Tickets: $6 - $12Buy tickets here! (https://www.even
 tbrite.com/e/srjc-orchestra-concert-take-flight-tickets-1985957895526)View
  the music department's event list here. (https://music.santarosa.edu/even
 ts)
