URL:https://tockify.com/pdaevents/detail/983/1778889600000
SUMMARY: Live Music with Callie Watts at Brooks Note Winery
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a premier vocalist & performer in the Bay Are
 a. She performs a rich blend of unique covers as well as original materia
 l. Her sweet and soulful voice covers the ranges of Joni Mitchell\, Bonni
 e Raitt\, Eva Cassidy\, among many others\, and she is guaranteed to garn
 er the attention of those in the room.
CATEGORIES:winery,live-music
