 six miles \, moving effortlessly through a living landscape of reeds\, bir
 ds\, and broad skies. Egrets lift off ahead of you\, herons stand sentinel
  along the banks\, and the river widens into its wilder self. Along the wa
 y\, we’ll share stories of this working tidal slough—its ecology\, its
  rhythms\, and why this stretch of river matters. At the finish\, reward y
 ourself with the optional Refresh Sesh at Sundrop Sauna . Step into the he
 at\, rinse\, reset\, and leave feeling energized—inside and out. Beginne
 r-friendly. Unforgettable. Be part of nature—and let the tide do the wor
