DESCRIPTION:Saturday Sunset Series: Open Late! There’s something magical
  about a summer evening on the Petaluma River. As the downtown lights begi
 n to glow and the tide shifts with the sunset\, the river slows down—and
  so do we. #block-66d2f3214730bd57ba51 { } #block-66d2f3214730bd57ba51 .sq
 s-html-content { } #block-66d2f3214730bd57ba51 { mix-blend-mode: var(--twe
