 (max-width: 767px) { } Spend some quality time in the heart of downtown Pe
 taluma! Rent a kayak\, canoe\, stand up paddle board\, pedal kayak\, water
  bike\, or bring your own craft and launch into the evening from our low d
 ocks! Cruise past the outdoor dining scene around the Turning Basin and Wa
 ter Street\, glide beneath the historic D Street Bridge\, or head out into
  the quieter stretches of the river where the marsh begins to take over. O
 n especially high tides\, adventurous paddlers can even sneak upstream int
 o peaceful hidden reaches. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778459971505_2573 { } #blo
