DESCRIPTION:Our building will be open Saturday\, May 16 for Petaluma's Sal
 ute to American Graffiti car show. Stop in for a cold soda pop and a place
  to sit down. And then stick around for Spike Sikes and his Awesome Hotcak
 es in the evening from 7:30–10PM. Tickets are $25 in advance\, $30 at th
 e door (cash or card). #block-78e0f9e3cbc238856555 { --stroke-style: none\
