DESCRIPTION:End-of-life planning doesn't have to be overwhelming. Join our
  expert panel for a practical\, compassionate conversation on estate plann
 ing\, finances\, advance directives and funeral planning. Walk away with c
 larity\, confidence and peace of mind. Whether you are just beginning to t
 hink about these issues or ready to put plans into place\, this program wi
 ll offer helpful information\, trusted resources and a supportive space to
  ask questions. To register\, email Info@villagenetworkofpetaluma.org or c
 all 776-6055
