SUMMARY:Annual Retreat
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260526
DTSTAMP:20260514T024000Z
UID:73lcb65m6ia1rp3ro2iph2cpep@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20260522
SEQUENCE:0
ATTENDEE;CN=uupetaluma@gmail.com;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;ROLE=
 REQ-PARTICIPANT;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:uupetaluma@gmail.com
CREATED:20260420T192759Z
DESCRIPTION:Our yearly retreat is back to its usual Memorial Day Weekend
  (May 22 - 25) in the Napa Hills. Enjoy swimming\, boating on a lake\, si
 nging\, crafting\, cooking\, eating delicious food we prepare\, and lots o
 f time to relax and get to know each other better. For details and to regi
 ster\, please fill out either the <a href="https://uupetaluma.us7.list-ma
 nage.com/track/click?u=edc8c20cfba1f0fc8871ba046&amp\;id=81d8ed7cb2&amp\;e
 =89b7cc1074" target="_blank"><b><i><u>Registration form online</u></i></b>
 </a> or get a paper copy on Sunday morning. The deadline to apply and pay
  is May 6\, but please be aware that space is limited. The deadline to ask
  for a scholarship is May 3. Please email any questions to Diana Spaulding
   (<a href="mailto:membership@uupetaluma.org?subject=2026%20UUP%20Retreat
 &amp\;body=" target="_blank"><b><i><u>membership@uupetaluma.org</u></i></b
 ></a>) <wbr />or Lara Abel (<a href="mailto:laraa@uupetaluma.org?subject
 =2026%20UUP%20Retreat&amp\;body=" target="_blank"><b><i><u>laraa@uupetalum
 a.org</u></i></b></a>) or see retreat committee members available after s
 ervices in the social hall.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260420T200152Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
