DESCRIPTION:🌕 Blue Moon Paddle / Pedal Saturday\, May 30\, 2026 | 7:30
 –9:30 pm The Floathouse Join us for a rare and beautiful evening on Peta
 luma River —Petaluma’s Longest Park—under a Blue Moon \, the second 
 full moon of the month. (The first graced us on May 1st\; this is the enco
 re.) Come Play on the River at Night. In our Hobie pedal kayaks\, it truly
  feels like play. No matter the tide\, and even if the evening breeze pick
 s up\, we’ll simply pedal along—effortless and smooth—about a mile a
 nd a half downriver to the spot where the moon rises over the wetlands tha
 t frame our horizon. #block-6f81de4a776bf76f4bca { --stroke-style: none\;-
