X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Petaluma Figure Drawing": "https://www.meetup.com/petaluma-figure-drawing-meetup-group/events/314496897/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_figure_drawing
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Petaluma Figure Drawing
UID:event_314496897@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260514T023946Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T170000
SUMMARY:Now accepting Artists! 
DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Figure Drawing Meetup Group\n| Suite G Studio is accepting artist to exhibit work for Sonoma County's Art at the Source\, Saturday June 6th and 7th\, 10am - 5pm. |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|\n\n| Exhibiting artists will be given 6 feet of linear space to hang their art in any way they choose. Artists can also set up a tables or racks to display their work. The exhibit will be open the entire weekend. For more information\, or to apply\, email suitegstudio620@gmail.com Cost $200 |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|\n\n**for More information go to [Art Show!](Figure Drawing @Suite G Studio THIS Wednesday 4/22 6:30pm - 8:30pm 620 Petaluma Blvd. N Join us for an evening of creativity and inspiration at the Petaluma Figure Drawing Night at Suite G Studio! Whether you're a seasoned artist or just starting out\, this event is the perfect opportunity to hone your skills\, meet fellow artists\, and immerse yourself in the world of figurative painting. Our life drawing sessions are open to artists and art lovers of all levels\, so don't be shy to join us and express your creativity on paper. We provide a supportive and encouraging environment where everyone can feel comfortable exploring their artistic talents. BECOME A MEMBER of Suite G Studio for $40/month. Or RSVP by sending $25 to @suiteg on Venmo or email suitegstudio620@gmail.com Be prepared for an evening filled with sketching\, painting\, and drawing as we focus on capturing the human form in all its beauty and complexity. This event is a great opportunity to practice your figure drawing techniques and unleash your artistic potential. Whether you prefer using pencils\, charcoal\, pastels\, or paint\, there's something for everyone at our Figure Drawing Night. Come and be a part of our community of artists dedicated to celebrating and expressing the beauty of life through art.)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/petaluma-figure-drawing-meetup-group/events/314496897/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260426T201438Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260426T201438Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/2/4/9/600_534101545.jpeg
END:VEVENT
