X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Floathouse": "https://www.thefloathousepetaluma.org/events/strawberry-moon-paddle-pedal-june-28-2026"}
X-SOURCE-ID:floathouse
SUMMARY:Full Strawberry Moon Paddle/Pedal 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T213000
UID:d7cef413fd4bd0283a47421d57e088a2@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1768438453114-SFSNJNR45IK4061CEEJF/_FINAL+Strawberr
 y+Moon+paddlepedal+June+28%2C+2026+730-930+pm+Squarespace+event+image++%28
 1500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:🍓 Strawberry Moon Paddle / Pedal Sunday\, June 28\, 2026 | 
 7:30–9:30 pm Join us for a warm summer evening on the Petaluma River und
 er the Strawberry Moon \, a name shared by many Native American cultures t
 o mark the season of ripening fruit\, blooming plants\, and new life. This
  guided nighttime paddle in Hobie pedal kayaks is playful\, easy\, and per
 fect for lingering summer light and rising moonshine. Pedal along with you
 r community as the river reflects the glow of early summer. June’s Full 
 Moon is known by many names\, each rooted in seasonal rhythms: Strawberry 
 Moon — Algonquin\, Ojibwe\, Dakota\, and Lakota peoples\; the time when 
 wild strawberries were ready to gather Berries Ripen Moon — Haida\; mark
 ing the ripening of fruits Blooming Moon — Anishinaabe\; celebrating pea
 k flowering season Green Corn Moon — Cherokee\; signaling the tending of
  crops Hoer Moon — Western Abenaki\; associated with agricultural work H
 ot Moon — An 18th-century term recorded by Captain Jonathan Carver\, ref
 lecting early summer heat Birth Moon — Tlingit\; the season when animals
  give birth Egg Laying Moon / Hatching Moon — Cree\; marking new life em
 erging across the land These names remind us that this moon is about abund
 ance\, growth\, and connection—perfect themes for an evening on the wate
 r. Event Details • Strawberry Moon Paddle / Pedal • Sunday\, June 28\,
  2026 • 7:30–9:30 pm $60 per person includes: Hobie pedal kayak\, expe
 rienced guide\, PFD\, all gear\, and summer moonlight on the river. Book h
 ere! 🍓 Come play on the river at night and celebrate the season of berr
 ies\, blooms\, and long summer evenings. #block-653713b2782b5824cb96 { --s
 troke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background
 -color: initial\; } #block-653713b2782b5824cb96 .sqs-html-content { --twea
 k-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%\; --tweak-text-block-padding: initial\; 
 } #block-653713b2782b5824cb96 { mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-ble
 nd )\; border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius)\; } #block-653713b278
 2b5824cb96 { --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px\; } #block-653713b
 2782b5824cb96 { } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { #block-653713b278
 2b5824cb96 { } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { #block-653713b2782
 b5824cb96 .sqs-html-content { } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { }
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma\, 50 Water Street\, Petaluma\, CA 94952
URL:https://www.thefloathousepetaluma.org/events/strawberry-moon-paddle-pe
 dal-june-28-2026
